The NEWS file for the easpanel package.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2.0.0rc6 - 26 June 2026

EasPanel. Adjusted minimum main window size from 1020x786 to 1020x734.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2.0.0rc5 - 25 June 2026

DirectPanel. Fixed a bug that caused event file backup to fail when the
BackupDestination resided on a different filesystem than the Path.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2.0.0rc4 - 25 June 2026

Configuration. Refactored the configuration layout to put separate
configuration files for the easp(1), directp(1) and easbelt(8) programs
within the '/etc/easpanel/' directory.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2.0.0rc3 - 24 June 2026

DirectPanel. Fixed a bug that cause a UDP port conflict between easp(1)
and directp(1).

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2.0.0rc2 - 24 June 2026

DirectPanel. Added the ability to remotely set the mode of an operating
panel instance by means of the '--automatic' and '--paused' command line
switches.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2.0.0rc1 - 23 June 2026

New Applet. Added a directp(1) applet for fully automatic direct file
insertions.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2.0.0rc0 - 12 June 2026

Update the Qt dependency to use Qt5.

Added Flatpak support.

Added DEB packaging support.

Added support for 'BLU' (Blue Alert) and 'MEP' (Missing and Endnagered Person)
event code support.

Added support for direct file imports.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1.0.0rc0 - 1 October 2020

Initial release candidate.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
0.9.0 - 28 September 2018

The fourth beta release.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
0.8.0 - 20 September 2018

The third beta release.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
0.5.1 - 7 September 2018

The second beta release.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
0.5.0 - 7 September 2018

The initial beta release.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
